abstract: >-
  Raw time-of-flight histogram data, processed results, microscopy images and
  MATLAB code supporting the article "Toward Soft Optical Networks for
  Deformation Sensing". The code (GPL-3.0) reproduces the plotted figures from
  the data (CC0-1.0).
